            <div xml:id="m-3e991011-b114-41af-820a-c3d4aaee131b">
              <lg xml:id="m-d4440017-c41b-4381-ac55-85106e25b300">
                <l xml:id="m-9344778c-5584-436b-9c1d-18a9e24fdf23" facs="#m-b876bbb1-646d-4a9a-b95a-f4135187b8a5" label="text-like">21st Sunday after Pentecost.</l><l xml:id="m-2154a15b-0d5b-4c0d-9b5f-d0b61bb66729" facs="#m-83a9e3e6-e0c3-454b-84c9-9e09292a3ec2" label="ambiguous">1067</l><l xml:id="m-512c1bfb-9f9d-4ea5-92fd-74b651771aba" facs="#m-1d012578-8a03-40b2-8e50-3aa20647e0cd" label="lyrics-like">ámbu-lant in lége Dómini. Gló-ri-a Pátri. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-617b9443-b795-46fb-a833-dbc830b7f8da" facs="#m-c58a37f1-5b1a-4b2d-8289-2c06c9ff7ef0" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-ae29b6aa-2cd8-4c16-9bab-bc27d784abd8" facs="#m-aa227064-fe1b-4c95-b7d6-940d5d603e1e" label="lyrics-like">L'Amiliam tuam, quaésumus Dó-] protegénte sit libera, *et in bonis</l><l xml:id="m-ea38320c-c7bd-45ad-a03d-90704299a5a3" facs="#m-2e465a72-02f2-4fbc-93e7-3fd943128bda" label="lyrics-like">mine, contínua pietáte custó- áctibus tuo nómini sit devóta. Per</l><l xml:id="m-dc1863ad-b9fe-41a3-a36d-f64cdb56b9fc" facs="#m-9c940e0d-0a11-4720-9370-c467a8037587" label="lyrics-like">di:t ut a cunctis adversitátibus te! Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-f3592331-c4d0-4afd-8e7d-1e265e46b1c9" facs="#m-8c13e57c-4e33-49ac-8e8c-a6dd730e11a6" label="text-like">2. A cunctis. p. 498. — 3. At the priest's choice.</l><l xml:id="m-52d80512-3dad-41d2-84ad-43283d8d2faf" facs="#m-5067e7a6-801b-4724-895a-d618765169bb" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Ephesios. Ephes. 6. b.</l><l xml:id="m-8dda5844-8951-41f7-aab6-5729bc3f7462" facs="#m-a9f9c93f-da2d-4d49-8d1a-3c163ffe7f43" label="lyrics-like">L'Ratres: Confortámini in Dó- possítis resistere in die malo, et in</l><l xml:id="m-a349de3e-1fea-4d46-83dd-8a74eaffc078" facs="#m-4d00de73-7a2b-4eac-b57b-76a9220c0500" label="lyrics-like">mino, et in poténtia virtútis</l><l xml:id="m-0ce01f2f-f3b0-4b4e-bbdd-e65377c8d45a" facs="#m-f3f34163-5a80-4348-9ea4-fdf99c601a32" label="lyrics-like">ómnibus perfécti stare. State ergo</l><l xml:id="m-0ac29c25-e195-4066-bc7b-d315eb088a5f" facs="#m-f457a777-f161-4c83-a50f-ad7ac7632774" label="lyrics-like">ejus. Indúite vos armatúram Dei,</l><l xml:id="m-f2299301-ba00-41fc-a77b-775386f33091" facs="#m-4fb752e0-9a63-4555-9baf-cbd1c20a2645" label="lyrics-like">succíncti lumbos vestros in veritáte,</l><l xml:id="m-8ae61fa8-1cff-4415-83cf-dfea9e13e909" facs="#m-6ef2357b-8e68-4038-8ff2-27bfb5542355" label="lyrics-like">ut possítis stare advérsus insídias</l><l xml:id="m-dcbbdc58-0b54-493a-a0ac-ad9ec51c7f34" facs="#m-ca6860b3-3f4d-427d-8388-065987ce77e1" label="lyrics-like">et indúti loricam justítiae, et calceáti</l><l xml:id="m-1541306c-1cd3-44ae-b325-820816eeb44e" facs="#m-29ed3ee5-8bd0-4228-8d93-f71f8d2fa0a4" label="lyrics-like">diáboli. Quóniam non est nobis col¬</l><l xml:id="m-c5a8829a-bb8f-439b-96dd-101536c15045" facs="#m-af37b7fd-c35a-46a4-8dc2-365af766b6fa" label="lyrics-like">pedes in praeparatióne Evangélii</l><l xml:id="m-d5316c7c-11b2-4da4-a29d-03ce67cd1f15" facs="#m-a9c7b051-fc7a-492b-9f85-ac59cfac9c31" label="lyrics-like">luctátio advérsus carnem et sángui¬</l><l xml:id="m-1c14075b-d7ce-4436-b459-3f1a498debfb" facs="#m-67d810fd-768e-40c3-8a6a-5aa727ab0bcd" label="lyrics-like">pacis: in ómnibus suméntes scutum</l><l xml:id="m-93c2070d-8fd5-4312-9398-70543656a9a6" facs="#m-c2ff0db7-9089-48ed-abee-fdbf0fc82924" label="lyrics-like">fidei, in quo possítis ómnia tela ne¬</l><l xml:id="m-c9919f11-866c-459f-9366-fe8915394d4b" facs="#m-24cf24e3-3755-44f4-bfd7-71652c33caab" label="lyrics-like">nem: sed advérsus principes et po¬</l><l xml:id="m-9f7defe3-ded3-4868-9e97-ba72ec5d14c0" facs="#m-da0d8e68-b85e-4282-ac0c-70abc4662f98" label="lyrics-like">testátes, advérsus mundi rectóres</l><l xml:id="m-a042ae38-5b71-49e4-b3af-4d33783f860e" facs="#m-f94f1c64-b1e9-453c-b9ea-d95ad1cf5609" label="lyrics-like">quíssimi ignéa exstinguere: et gá¬</l><l xml:id="m-838f818d-e8be-4f8e-aa60-941d3445357d" facs="#m-cf0fa56e-47c5-4fdc-a0eb-19e555ea1879" label="lyrics-like">leam salútis assúmite: et gládium</l><l xml:id="m-dddf18d2-fb96-4e1f-aa42-da52b6631e74" facs="#m-7428200b-4be4-4124-bbe7-b86558451a51" label="lyrics-like">tenebrárum harum, contra spirituá¬</l><l xml:id="m-fbdffe62-a57c-4bb3-bf58-c560c3206f47" facs="#m-d10d0c79-2b39-4a1b-8457-11909b5f0bff" label="lyrics-like">lia nequítiae, in caeléstibus. Pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-b4ba1d05-c9b0-475a-96a5-4d0dcdcde97e" facs="#m-b106b63d-7f83-47da-9b1d-f26ac4b73e2d" label="lyrics-like">spíritus, quod est verbum Dei.</l><l xml:id="m-a3721547-bf66-40d7-83e6-e0dc3af9304c" facs="#m-07dfab9c-1961-4f63-be28-56cc03e41546" label="lyrics-like">ptérea accipite armatúram Dei, ut</l><l xml:id="m-21e21bac-6718-4ab5-bb5b-378d5c5717a8" facs="#m-1e5d5589-3b8f-4d7d-9f07-c116a677bac4" label="ambiguous">Grad.</l><l xml:id="m-70a63687-6baa-4ecb-8d94-8fe9840c3d68" facs="#m-d2ca80dc-e6df-4cd1-8e52-b197bdf2f899" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-0f177eb3-2a58-4515-9bd9-e9f68a6316ac" facs="#m-38a3c691-2ee9-45bc-99f0-5aa0bf53c08c" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-b1965fa6-7d02-4ed6-9bce-988433c07f68" facs="#m-b848f32c-800f-4b93-ad30-54b15db92ee4" label="lyrics-like">gi- um fá-ctus es</l><l xml:id="m-2718c79d-c1c9-4c40-9dfe-3913420868ad" facs="#m-ece151d8-9081-4d62-b5c7-79e0f7c71d60" label="lyrics-like">Omine, * re-fú¬</l><l xml:id="m-7a582d87-4066-43e5-8d62-3f6f79db5ca2" facs="#m-eb5579ad-9b08-4a54-84a5-bdd47239f94d" label="lyrics-like">nó- bis,</l><l xml:id="m-390eff50-4e62-4542-b12c-541f453665ea" facs="#m-a796058c-851f-4a61-8802-dde032dc41af" label="lyrics-like">a gene-ra-ti-6́¬</l><l xml:id="m-ae802fa7-5729-456a-a9f8-e1929a4381c1" facs="#m-c0667ea1-c025-4612-b6c2-21960664bb4f" label="ambiguous">ne</l><l xml:id="m-1d8645f1-5cb1-44e8-a2df-75fe9102c943" facs="#m-59f327ac-fa43-477a-a79e-e85ea272b107" label="lyrics-like">et progé-ni-e</l><l xml:id="m-cf3d24b2-29c3-4a14-bef3-1ab60025dd12" facs="#m-7a7ba427-260a-4b46-be0f-5e697ffa9962" label="lyrics-like">V. Pri-úsquam món¬</l><l xml:id="m-b4b6180a-d44a-4c5d-8cbd-02154028ef75" facs="#m-d11477e2-ac1c-4be6-8fd6-8f00d442ec4c" label="lyrics-like">tes fí¬</l><l xml:id="m-9a5a205e-039e-47aa-a01a-3c182622fd1d" facs="#m-67101c2a-c690-472c-9519-7af07cf52f22" label="lyrics-like">e-rent, aut forma-ré-tur tér¬</l><l xml:id="m-045f1a5e-1871-4a93-9b49-e6a2de6e2dc3" facs="#m-371bb5af-18f0-4682-9202-eec708fed228" label="lyrics-like">et órbis: a saé¬</l><l xml:id="m-441c1141-b818-4b2f-ab01-4befe6b16d88" facs="#m-a5c47c0f-53bc-4fc4-95ee-f1a079eb79b3" label="ambiguous">cu-lo.</l><l xml:id="m-faaa6148-15a5-4875-83bc-f2af1f99c7a1" facs="#m-a290237c-341e-4fab-8919-1832f86c90c8" label="ambiguous">ra</l><l xml:id="m-32ac176c-169c-4f37-9a09-6bdc0e3097e8" facs="#m-65822c3d-2ac2-4ffd-b6d0-7b2ca38954f5" label="ambiguous" /></lg>
